"test":{"name":"script-terrain-moved-fresh","kind":"rules","opponent":"Human","rounds":"4","check":"scriptTerrainMovedFresh","question":"Unit Moved, On Terrain, Cover Below, Order Units' Target Fresh, Salute: a Red grunt moved onto hills counts for On Terrain Hills, then onto a road for 'Road, Forest' (one of two); every move counts for Unit Moved; the Blue tank, ordered at the strongest Red unit it can reach, passes over the hurt grunt nearer it for the full-strength one (ties: the one in the forest), whose hit counts for On Terrain Forest and not Cover Below 2; a hurt grunt hit on grass counts for Cover Below 2; a salute (headless: nothing shown) hits nobody.","rules":"standard"},
